+    """The failure path of the v0.7.0 worker for a task error
+    (``_persist_failed_attempt``, horsies/core/worker/finalize.py:1467-1523 at
+    v0.7.0): the retry-facts read, then ``horsies_finish_failed_attempt``.
+
